note bottom of t_agent_binding_tools
tool_id uses tool- plus 32 hex characters.
NULL tool_version means latest.
NULL permission means inherit.
Every permission Tool must also be bound.
end note

note bottom of t_agent_binding_skills
skill_id uses skill- plus 32 hex characters.
NULL skill_version means latest.
Rows are returned by skill_id.
end note

note bottom of t_agent_binding_agents
Self-binding and duplicate targets are rejected.
The target Agent must currently exist.
NULL bound_agent_version means latest.
Rows are returned by bound_agent_id.
end note

note bottom of t_agent_definition
Base DDL omits physical foreign keys for
GaussDB Distributed compatibility.
The service maintains logical relationships
